      "en": "- Dekton® by Cosentino: the most complete range, with the 3,300 × 1,630 mm Jumbo format, four pattern families (Natural, Solid, Tech, Industrial), X-Gloss, matt and Velvet finishes, and thicknesses from 8 to 30 mm.\n- Neolith (The Size range): slabs up to 3,200 × 1,500 mm in 6 and 12 mm, well suited to seamless walls and splashbacks, in polished, matt or satin Silk.\n- Infinity: porcelain made in Italy, known for its marble, stone and concrete effects, in 12 and 20 mm.\n- MStone ceramic: non-porous, certified for food contact, UV stable, with four finishes including the textured Soft 3D.\n- Materia: a short, matt-only collection inspired by concrete, limestone and earth.\n\nWe source the brand and colour specified on your drawings.",
