      "en": "High polish is the easiest to clean and intensifies the colours. Suede, matt and soft to the touch, gives a more natural look and limits reflections, but shows greasy marks more, which come off with a suitable cleaner. Volcano, textured, recalls raw stone and suits projects with a strong style. Not every colour comes in all three finishes.",
