      "en": "Both are matt, but not in the same way. Honed is achieved by stopping the polishing before it reaches a shine: it is understated and natural. Texta is a specific Cosentino treatment that gives a velvety, silky and even softer feel, and a surface less prone to fingerprints. The best approach is to compare both samples by touch with your client.",
