      "en": "Yes. The Texta treatment improves stain resistance, meaning the penetration of coloured liquids, but it does not make marble immune to acids. Lemon juice, vinegar or a descaler can leave a dull mark on the surface. Guidance for the client: wipe up these liquids quickly and clean with a mild, pH-neutral soap.",
