      "en": "Yes, its dense, non-porous surface does not let liquids soak in and is easy to clean. It suits a kitchen with moderate use, with the right habits: trivets for hot dishes, a chopping board and no abrasive products on the honed finish. For a very intensive or outdoor kitchen, ceramic is the better option: we fabricate both.",
