      "en": "No. CB Prod does not take measurements on site or set pieces in place. Surveying the staircase, often tricky on an existing structure or a concrete flight, remains your responsibility or that of your partners. We check your drawings for consistency before manufacturing and flag any inconsistency in rise or going.",
