      "en": "Granite is often the first choice: hard and little affected by frost and weather, it accepts textured finishes that improve grip. Some ceramics designed for outdoor use are also possible, depending on the range. Avoid polished finishes outdoors. Describe the exposure and use to us and we will point you towards suitable references and their documentation.",
