      "en": "Filter the projects by type of room and read the caption under each photo: it gives the material and often the colour. It is a simple way to show your client a look, an edge or a cut-out before finalising their project.\n\nWhen you send us an enquiry, attach the reference images to your dimensioned drawings. We grasp the expected result faster and can flag a technical constraint at the study stage, before the quote reaches your client.\n\nRemind them too that natural stone is never identical from one slab to the next. For a marble or quartzite with strong veining, the safest option is to come and choose the slab at our Igreja Nova factory, by appointment, on your own or with your client, before production starts.",
