      "en": "Email direction@cbproducao.com or call +33 (1) 88 32 64 49 from France, or +351 219 672 216 from Portugal. Tell us about your company, your trade and the kind of projects you handle, then send us a first file with drawings and materials. We study it and reply with a quote within 48 working hours.",
