      "en": "It depends on the material, the style and the cabinet structure. A slim thickness gives a fine, contemporary look, very popular in ceramic. A thicker top asserts the presence of an island or a natural stone. Available thicknesses vary by range: tell us about the project and we will tell you which ones are suitable.",
