      "en": "Yes. A French line is available on +33 (1) 88 32 64 49, Monday to Friday from 8.00am to 5.30pm. You can also email direction@cbproducao.com with your drawings and technical files attached. Our trade customers in France are looked after in exactly the same way as those in Portugal, from the first enquiry through to delivery.",
