      "en": "CB Prod manufactures for trade customers, who handle surveying and setting in place for their own clients. If you have a kitchen or bathroom project, please speak to your kitchen studio or stonemason, who can entrust the manufacturing to us. You can also turn to the brands of our group: CB Surfaces, Easy Plan or Kitchenfab.",
